<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4462" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of another sort</i> or <i>kind,
				different</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.258
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.638
			</span></i> (v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.181
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλοτε ἀλλοῖος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					4(3).5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>P.</u>
				3.104
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.Apoll.
				2
			</span></i> : prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν πολλὰ βάλλῃς,
				ἄλλοτ᾽ ἀλλοῖον βαλεῖς</span> 'every bullet has its
			billet', <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				448
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοῖα φρονεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					108
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοῖόν τι,</span> euphem. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακόν τι</span>, <i>other than
			good</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.40
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τι γένοιτο ἀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arcesil.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.44
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂν . . [ὁ λόγος] ἀλλοιότερος φανἧ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					<u>Prooem.</u>
					32.4
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1.99
			</span></i> :—foll. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤ</span> . .
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				20c
			</span></i>, etc.; or by gen., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				836b
			</span></i> :—
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλοιότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.212
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.106
			</span></i>, D.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				280a12
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλο&lt;&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έστερος</span></span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				186
			</span></i>, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.190
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>containing</i> or <i>subject to diversity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				20
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>
			<i>otherwise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ly.</u>
				212d
			</span></i> : 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					4.8.2
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οτέρως</span>
			<i>worse</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Charis.
				80.17
			</span></i>.</div>
